We're not going to accept the report unconditionally," he added, however.
WADA ordered RUSAD to stop doping controls in Russia in November 2015 after the scope of the doping scandal was uncovered.
However, last June it was given permission to plan and co-ordinating testing under the supervision of international experts and UKAD.
